OL,4,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,5,     GCraig spins some joyous tunes to
OL,6,     Gget your weekend started, before
OL,7,     Gopening up the Trunk of Funk!
OL,8,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,9,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,10,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,11,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,12,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,13,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,14,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,15,     FKoleoso
OL,16,     GThe renowned UK Garage DJ and
OL,17,     GProducer paints a bright picture
OL,18,     Gof his ideal Friday night in and
OL,19,     Gnight out, and shares an iconic
OL,20,     GFriday he's had recently.
